// demo.dlg - generic placeholder story for the prototype. Not game content.
// The private story pack replaces this whole folder when it is present.

~doc demo_notice
@category system

title: Before you start  #line:demo_n_001
p: This is a generic demo for the prototype. It has no game story.  #line:demo_n_002
p: Esc opens the settings (scare mode, flashing, graphic content, volume, text size). M and P are shortcuts.  #line:demo_n_003


~doc demo_card_rec
@category board

title: Recorded clip  #line:demo_card_001
p: A clip you recorded with the camera (R) on the LINEAR track. Its timecode is pinned to the board.  #line:demo_card_002

~doc demo_card_lamp
@category board

title: Lamp switched on  #line:demo_card_003
p: Someone switched the lamp on. The flag stays on for the whole save.  #line:demo_card_004

~doc demo_card_end
@category board

title: End of the tape  #line:demo_card_005
p: The last card of the demo. It stays unknown until the demo ends.  #line:demo_card_006


~doc demo_knot_1
@category board_knot

title: First knot — the lamp  #line:demo_knot_001
p: Untied once someone switched the lamp on.  #line:demo_knot_002

~doc demo_knot_2
@category board_knot

title: Second knot — the clip  #line:demo_knot_003
p: Untied once the clip was recorded.  #line:demo_knot_004

~doc demo_answer_1
@category board_conclusion

title: The keeper  #line:demo_answer_001
p: The keeper told the rules.  #line:demo_answer_002


~ demo_intro
@style window
@once save

narrator: A tape is waiting in the deck.  #line:demo_i_001
- Play it  #line:demo_i_002
- Label it and play it  #line:demo_i_003
    set save.demo_labelled = true
narrator: The counter starts at zero.  #line:demo_i_004
system [to=notice]: Tape loaded.  #line:demo_i_005 #ctx:A notice at the top right instead of a dialogue line
=> END


~ demo_call
@requires sys.loop_count >= 2
@once save
@style window

guide: Did it play? Try the switch on the back if it sounds wrong.  #line:demo_c_001
set save.hifi_unlocked = true
=> END


~ demo_keeper
@style bubble

keeper: Keep to the path tonight.  #line:demo_k_001
=> END


~ demo_rules
@style bubble

if loop.track_hifi
    keeper: When I call, answer with me.  #line:demo_r_001
else
    keeper: If someone calls your name, do not answer.  #line:demo_r_002
=> END


~ demo_call_linear
@forbids loop.track_hifi
@style bubble

voice: Hello-  #line:demo_x_001
- "Who is it?"  #line:demo_x_002
    do emit scare_demo_jump
- (Stay quiet)  #line:demo_x_003
=> END


~cue demo_sting
voice [at=0.0] [dur=1.2]: Press one-  #line:demo_s_001


~ demo_dark_linear
@requires loop.power_cut
@forbids loop.track_hifi
@style caption

narrator: The lights go out.  #line:demo_d_001
do emit scare_demo_dark
=> END


~ demo_dark_hifi
@requires loop.track_hifi and loop.power_cut
@style bubble

keeper: The lights are out. Keep going anyway.  #line:demo_d_002
set save.demo_done = true
=> END


~bark demo_crowd
@cooldown 4

crowd: Quiet tonight.  #line:demo_b_001
crowd: Look how low the water is.  #line:demo_b_002


// Workroom action (hub "actions", key N): a note on the deck.
~ demo_notes
@style window

narrator: A note on the deck says to check the switch at the back.  #line:demo_note_001
=> END


// After the last tape: close out the job. The level's bot_prefer picks the second option.
~ demo_close
@requires save.demo_done
@once save
@style window

narrator: The tape has run to the end. Time to file it.  #line:demo_cl_001
- Ship it as it is  #line:demo_cl_002
    set save.demo_ending = 1
- File it with notes  #line:demo_cl_003
    set save.demo_ending = 2
narrator: A label goes on the spine.  #line:demo_cl_004
if sys.gore
    narrator: A dark smear runs across the label.  #line:demo_cl_008 #ctx:Placeholder for a graphic line. sys.gore is the Graphic Content setting (on by default)
else
    narrator: The label is plain.  #line:demo_cl_009 #ctx:Placeholder for the veiled version of the line above
system [to=os_dialog]: Filing complete.  #line:demo_cl_005 #ctx:Meta output. Without the player's consent it is a window drawn inside the game
system [to=window_title]: Demo, filed  #line:demo_cl_006 #ctx:Meta output. Without consent, a title bar along the top
narrator [to=desktop_file]: A note: the tape is filed.  #line:demo_cl_007 #ctx:Meta output. Without consent, a journal note
set save.demo_closed = true
=> END

~doc demo_end
@category system

title: End of the demo  #line:demo_end_001
p: The level's end_docs show this card when the end flag turns on.  #line:demo_end_002

~doc demo_credits
@category system

title: Prototype demo  #line:demo_credits_001
p: Generic placeholder content for testing the prototype.  #line:demo_credits_002
p: The level's credits block rolls this document after the end card.  #line:demo_credits_003
p: Godot Engine is available under the MIT license.  #line:demo_credits_004
